<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $100 mln Dec 1999 bond. [CORRECTED 13:13 GMT]</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets $100 mln Dec 1999 bond. [CORRECTED 13:13 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Generale de Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN INTERNATIONAL SA</p>
<p> LETTER OF COMFORT/MAINTENANCE OF OWNERSHIP FROM LANDESBANK</p>
<p> SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    31.DEC.99 (corrects)</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.20    PAY DATE  S-01.APR.97 (corrects)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> YIELD	5.53 PCT  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  1.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE NOVEMBER 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
